ernate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm4gn9xnn1ppo--55ee5feb0ebc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm4gn9xnn1ppo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Sensor Tower estimates the game has already made $1.18bn from pre-orders across PlayStation and Xbox</summary></entry><entry><title>US government confirms investigation into tech firm Megaspeed</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn504nq5033o#0</id><updated>2026-11-17T17:44:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T11:17:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn504nq5033o--04b96a357bee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmn504nq5033o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The Singapore-based company is suspected of helping to ship high-end AI chips from tech giant Nvidia to China, violating US export rules.</summary></entry><entry><title>'We're a capitalist society': Grindr defends $120 a month premium tier</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr1ewlqjn694o#0</id><updated>2026-11-17T17:45:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T09:41:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr1ewlqjn694o--37027c5afa28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr1ewlqjn694o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">It says the ultra-premium service is intended for a "small community" of users - and could get more expensive in future.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia dismisses 'Bring Jensen Back' campaign as Trump backs effort to reinstate ex boss</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cry49plv8v3go#0</id><updated>2026-11-17T17:42:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:37:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cry49plv8v3go--4dfe5806c8ee.html" type="text/ht